"            <div>\n"
"                <p>The synchronization of the products availability for "
"Amazon Account\n"
"                    <b><t t-out=\"ctx.get('amazon_account') or ''\">REF</t></"
"b>\n"
"                    encountered some errors and was not completed.</p>\n"
